ntColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Solutions<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Resources<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Compare<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button></nav></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/\" class=\"hidden text-[15px] font-semibold lg:inline \">Sign in</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"hidden px-4 py-2.5 lg:inline-flex btn btn-ghost\">Start free</a><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"hidden px-[18px] py-2.5 lg:inline-flex btn btn-primary\">Book a demo</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-lg border lg:hidden border-line bg-white text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"wrap pb-2 pt-[140px] sm:pt-[160px]\"><div class=\"grid items-end gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr]\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Guides</span><h1 class=\"mt-4 max-w-[720px] font-display text-[clamp(34px,5vw,54px)] font-semibold leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.025em]\">Playbooks for professional-services firms.</h1><p class=\"lead mt-5 max-w-[600px]\">Practical, opinionated guides on planning work, keeping status honest, and catching risk early. Drawn from how high-performing teams actually run projects, not how the textbooks say they should.</p></div><div class=\"hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-card lg:block\"><p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted\">Looking for something specific?</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Browse by category below, or check the<!-- --> <a class=\"font-semibold text-accent hover:underline\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\">knowledge base</a> <!-- -->for step-by-step how-tos and the<!-- --> <a class=\"font-semibold text-accent hover:underline\" href=\"/blog/\">blog</a> <!-- -->for what we&#x27;re thinking about.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"wrap pt-12 sm:pt-16\"><div class=\"mb-7 flex items-end justify-between gap-6\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-[26px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]\">Featured</h2><span class=\"text-[13px] text-muted\">Start with these</span></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e515, #4f46e505)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#4f46e5\">Planning</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#4f46e5\">Planning</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">8 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">Plan an engagement in an afternoon</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">Go from a one-line goal to a full plan with tasks, owners, and a realistic timeline. The framework we use to compress days of scoping into a single working session.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0d948815, #0d948805)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#0d9488\">Status</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#0d9488\">Status</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">6 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">Kill the status meeting</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">How to let AI draft status from the actual work so your team reclaims the thirty minutes they spend reporting on it every week.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #dc262615, #dc262605)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#dc2626\">Risk</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#dc2626\">Risk</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">7 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">Spot risk before it bites</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">Read the early signals (workload, deadlines, dependency shape), and act while there&#x27;s still time to change the outcome instead of just announcing the slip.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a></div></section><section class=\"wrap pt-14\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-[26px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]\">Browse by topic</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] text-muted\">From a one-line goal to firm-wide rollout, guides for every stage.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><a href=\"#cat-planning\" class=\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #4f46e5\">Planning<span class=\"ml-2 text-[12px] text-muted\">4</span></a><a href=\"#cat-status\" class=\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #0d9488\">Status<span class=\"ml-2 text-[12px] text-muted\">3</span></a><a href=\"#cat-risk\" class=\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #dc2626\">Risk<span class=\"ml-2 text-[12px] text-muted\">3</span></a><a href=\"#cat-rollout\" class=\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #9333ea\">Rollout<span class=\"ml-2 text-[12px] text-muted\">3</span></a><a href=\"#cat-ai\" class=\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #f97316\">AI<span class=\"ml-2 text-[12px] text-muted\">2</span></a><a href=\"#cat-workflows\" class=\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #0ea5e9\">Workflows<span class=\"ml-2 text-[12px] text-muted\">2</span></a></div></section><section id=\"cat-planning\" class=\"wrap pt-12 sm:pt-14\"><div class=\"mb-7 flex items-baseline gap-3\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background-color:#4f46e5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><h2 class=\"font-display text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]\">Planning</h2><span class=\"text-[13px] text-muted\">· <!-- -->4<!-- --> <!-- -->guides</span></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e515, #4f46e505)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#4f46e5\">Planning</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#4f46e5\">Planning</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">8 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">Plan an engagement in an afternoon</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">Go from a one-line goal to a full plan with tasks, owners, and a realistic timeline. The framework we use to compress days of scoping into a single working session.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e515, #4f46e505)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#4f46e5\">Planning</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#4f46e5\">Planning</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">5 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">Write a goal the AI actually understands</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">Small changes in how you phrase a goal produce dramatically better plans. A short reference with before-and-after examples.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e515, #4f46e505)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#4f46e5\">Planning</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#4f46e5\">Planning</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">6 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">Scope without padding</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">Padding is what we add when we don&#x27;t trust our estimates. Use signals from past engagements to plan tighter without burning the team.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e515, #4f46e505)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#4f46e5\">Planning</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#4f46e5\">Planning</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">7 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">Dependency-first planning</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">Map dependencies before tasks. It feels backwards, but it&#x27;s the single biggest unlock for plans that don&#x27;t unravel in week two.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a></div></section><section id=\"cat-status\" class=\"wrap pt-12 sm:pt-14\"><div class=\"mb-7 flex items-baseline gap-3\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background-color:#0d9488\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><h2 class=\"font-display text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]\">Status</h2><span class=\"text-[13px] text-muted\">· <!-- -->3<!-- --> <!-- -->guides</span></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0d948815, #0d948805)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#0d9488\">Status</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#0d9488\">Status</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">6 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">Kill the status meeting</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">How to let AI draft status from the actual work so your team reclaims the thirty minutes they spend reporting on it every week.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0d948815, #0d948805)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#0d9488\">Status</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#0d9488\">Status</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">5 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">Make status self-update</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">Wire your work board to the work itself (email, calendar, deal stages), so the picture is always real without anyone touching it.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0d948815, #0d948805)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#0d9488\">Status</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#0d9488\">Status</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">4 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">The 2-line update</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">A simple template for written updates that replace meetings, with examples from teams running real engagements.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a></div></section><section id=\"cat-risk\" class=\"wrap pt-12 sm:pt-14\"><div class=\"mb-7 flex items-baseline gap-3\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background-color:#dc2626\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><h2 class=\"font-display text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]\">Risk</h2><span class=\"text-[13px] text-muted\">· <!-- -->3<!-- --> <!-- -->guides</span></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #dc262615, #dc262605)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#dc2626\">Risk</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#dc2626\">Risk</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">7 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">Spot risk before it bites</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">Read the early signals (workload, deadlines, dependency shape), and act while there&#x27;s still time to change the outcome instead of just announcing the slip.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #dc262615, #dc262605)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#dc2626\">Risk</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#dc2626\">Risk</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">6 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">Read your throughput honestly</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">Throughput is a lagging indicator until you know what to compare it to. How to use it as an early warning rather than a vanity metric.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #dc262615, #dc262605)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#dc2626\">Risk</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#dc2626\">Risk</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">5 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">The Friday risk review</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">A 15-minute weekly ritual that catches 80% of avoidable misses. What to look at, in what order, and how to act on it.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a></div></section><section id=\"cat-rollout\" class=\"wrap pt-12 sm:pt-14\"><div class=\"mb-7 flex items-baseline gap-3\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background-color:#9333ea\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><h2 class=\"font-display text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]\">Rollout</h2><span class=\"text-[13px] text-muted\">· <!-- -->3<!-- --> <!-- -->guides</span></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #9333ea15, #9333ea05)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#9333ea\">Rollout</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#9333ea\">Rollout</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">8 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">Onboard a new team in week one</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">A simple sequence for moving an existing project into PYNGYN and getting everyone productive in the first week, not the first quarter.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #9333ea15, #9333ea05)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#9333ea\">Rollout</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#9333ea\">Rollout</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">7 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">Migrate from spreadsheets without losing context</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">What to bring over, what to leave behind, and how to keep the institutional knowledge that was hiding in column J.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #9333ea15, #9333ea05)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#9333ea\">Rollout</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#9333ea\">Rollout</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">9 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">Roll out across multiple teams or offices</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">A staged plan for going from one pilot team to firm-wide adoption without re-engineering everyone&#x27;s workflow at once.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a></div></section><section id=\"cat-ai\" class=\"wrap pt-12 sm:pt-14\"><div class=\"mb-7 flex items-baseline gap-3\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background-color:#f97316\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><h2 class=\"font-display text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]\">AI</h2><span class=\"text-[13px] text-muted\">· <!-- -->2<!-- --> <!-- -->guides</span></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #f9731615, #f9731605)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#f97316\">AI</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#f97316\">AI</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">5 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">Prompt PYNGYN better</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">The handful of phrasings that get sharper plans, better status drafts, and more useful risk callouts from the AI.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #f9731615, #f9731605)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#f97316\">AI</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#f97316\">AI</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">4 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">When to override the AI</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">The AI is a great first draft, not a manager. Where it tends to be wrong, how to spot it, and how to correct it once.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a></div></section><section id=\"cat-workflows\" class=\"wrap pt-12 sm:pt-14\"><div class=\"mb-7 flex items-baseline gap-3\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background-color:#0ea5e9\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><h2 class=\"font-display text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]\">Workflows</h2><span class=\"text-[13px] text-muted\">· <!-- -->2<!-- --> <!-- -->guides</span></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e915, #0ea5e905)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#0ea5e9\">Workflows</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#0ea5e9\">Workflows</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">8 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">The client engagement workflow</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">End-to-end: intake → plan → execution → wrap-up → retro. The reference workflow we recommend for services firms.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-soft\" href=\"/knowledge-base/\"><div class=\"relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e915, #0ea5e905)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"font-display text-[42px] font-bold opacity-25\" style=\"color:#0ea5e9\">Workflows</div></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]\" style=\"color:#0ea5e9\">Workflows</span><span class=\"text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-muted\">6 min<!-- --> read</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-display font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.015em] group-hover:text-accent text-[20px]\">The internal initiative workflow</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 flex-1 leading-relaxed text-muted text-[15px]\">Internal projects fail differently from client work. A lighter workflow tuned for ambiguity, shifting priorities, and no external deadline pressure.</p><span class=\"mt-4 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-accent\">Read guide →</span></div></a></div></section><section class=\"wrap pb-16 pt-16 sm:pb-20\"><div class=\"hero-dark relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] p-9 text-center sm:p-12\"><div class=\"hero-grid pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><h2 class=\"mx-auto max-w-[620px] font-display text-[clamp(24px,3.4vw,34px)] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em] text-white\">Want a guide built around your team?</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-[480px] text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-white/65\">Book a 30-minute walkthrough and we&#x27;ll map our playbook onto how your firm actually runs.</p><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"mt-7 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-accent px-7 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-white shadow-cta transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-accent-dk\">Book a demo →</a></div></div></section><section id=\"demo\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white px-7 py-[72px] text-center shadow-card\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-[420px] w-[420px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-accent-lt opacity-70 blur-[80px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"eyebrow relative\">Ready when you are</span><h2 class=\"title relative mx-auto mt-3.5 max-w-[680px] text-[clamp(30px,4.4vw,48px)]\">Stop managing the tool. Start shipping the work.</h2><p class=\"lead relative mx-auto mt-[18px]\">See PYNGYN run a real project in 30 minutes, and let AI handle the project management busywork.</p><div class=\"relative mt-[30px] flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Book a demo →</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Start free</a></div><p class=\"relative mt-4 text-sm text-muted\">30-minute walkthrough · Tailored to your team · No commitment</p></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-white pt-16 pb-10 text-sm text-muted\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_repeat(5,1fr)]\"><div><a class=\"mb-4 inline-block\" aria-label=\"pyngyn home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"pyngyn\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-8 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logo.webp\"/></a><p class=\"max-w-[230px] leading-relaxed\">The operating system for professional-services firms.</p><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.pyngyn.io&amp;hl=en_IN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-xl border border-line bg-white px-4 py-2.5 transition-colors hover:border-accent\" aria-label=\"Get PYNGYN on Google Play\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\